\mt1 THE GOSPEL ACCORDING TO ST. JOHN  
\c 3  
\p
\v 1 There \w was|strong="G2258"\w* a \w man|strong="G0444"\w* \w of|strong="G1537"\w* the \w Pharisees|strong="G5330"\w*, \w named|strong="G3686"\w* \w Nicodemus|strong="G3530"\w*, a \w ruler|strong="G0758"\w* of the \w Jews|strong="G2453"\w*:  
